    "rv_measure": "Garman-Klass (1980) range-based realized-variance PROXY from daily OHLC; intraday open-to-close, NOT 5-min RV",
    "factor": "rolling-250d PCA PC1 of standardized cross-asset log-RV, sign-fixed (SPY>0), OOS-extracted, lagged F_{t-1}",
